109
00:12:48,684 --> 00:12:52,437
Yes , well , of course that 'd be right .

110
00:12:52,604 --> 00:12:55,231
Thousands , millions .

111
00:12:55,399 --> 00:12:59,778
Devil of a long time , anyway , IN a manner of speakin ' .

112
00:12:59,945 --> 00:13:04,074
Only a million years ago . Quite a recent eruption , really .

113
00:13:05,450 --> 00:13:09,950
The rocks all around Mount Macedon itself must be all of 350 million years old .

114
00:13:14,918 --> 00:13:16,920
Siliceous lava

115
00:13:17,921 --> 00:13:20,924
