116
00:13:22,301 --> 00:13:26,801
Soda trachytes extruded in a highly viscous state ,

117
00:13:28,515 --> 00:13:32,894
building the steep-sided mametons we see in Hanging Rock .

118
00:13:35,105 --> 00:13:38,108
And quite young , geologically speaking .

119
00:13:38,275 --> 00:13:39,901
Barely a million years .

120
00:13:41,278 --> 00:13:44,155
Waiting a million years ...

121
00:13:44,323 --> 00:13:45,532
just for us .

122
00:13:56,752 --> 00:13:58,795
( BIRDS TWEETING )

123
00:14:08,138 --> 00:14:10,473
