00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:31,202
I think I 'll just , um , stretch my legs a bit .

127
00:14:31,370 --> 00:14:33,288
Oh , don 't go too far .

128
00:14:33,455 --> 00:14:36,708
And be careful - there could be snakes .

