132
00:15:18,708 --> 00:15:21,168
They finished eating , have they ?

133
00:15:21,336 --> 00:15:22,587
Pardon ?

134
00:15:24,589 --> 00:15:26,132
The colonel and the missus .

135
00:15:26,299 --> 00:15:28,551
- They finished eating , have they ? - Oh , yes , they have .

136
00:15:30,470 --> 00:15:33,806
Expect me up there in a minute , I suppose . Clear away .

137
00:15:40,605 --> 00:15:42,982
- Can 't be more 'n midday . - No .

138
00:15:44,901 --> 00:15:47,570
