139
00:15:47,737 --> 00:15:49,655
I thought it was a little early for lunch myself .

140
00:15:50,991 --> 00:15:52,242
Yeah .

141
00:15:54,369 --> 00:15:56,204
Drink ?

142
00:15:56,371 --> 00:15:57,872
Thanks .

143
00:16:03,295 --> 00:16:07,795
You know , they always allow an hour longer than it takes to get ' ere ,

144
00:16:08,049 --> 00:16:09,884
