145
00:16:11,511 --> 00:16:12,887
Thanks .

146
00:16:20,228 --> 00:16:21,479
Ta !

147
00:16:22,731 --> 00:16:25,692
Not that they got anything else to do .

148
00:16:25,859 --> 00:16:27,610
I mean , they never go for a walk or nothin ' .

149
00:16:43,126 --> 00:16:46,629
MR HUSSEY : Get on ! Come on !

150
00:17:00,602 --> 00:17:03,146
( SHOUTS OF EXCITEMENT )

151
00:17:15,158 --> 00:17:18,744
- ( BIRDS TWEETING ) - ( HORSES WHINNY )

152
00:17:21,248 --> 00:17:23,625
( LOW , HAUNTING PANPIPE MUSIC )

153
00:17:30,966 --> 00:17:35,466
- MIRANDA : To St Valentine ! - ALL : To St Valentine !

154
00:17:35,887 --> 00:17:37,680
( CHEERING )

155
00:17:37,847 --> 00:17:39,056
( MUSIC STOPS )

156
00:17:39,224 --> 00:17:40,391
( LOW RUMBLING )

157
00:17:41,768 --> 00:17:44,479
