159
00:18:19,306 --> 00:18:21,891
I hope you have learned your poetry , Sara .

160
00:18:22,892 --> 00:18:24,268
Sit up straight , child .

161
00:18:24,436 --> 00:18:27,897
Hold your shoulders back . You 're getting a dreadful stoop .

162
00:18:28,064 --> 00:18:30,274
Well , have you got your lines by heart ?

163
00:18:31,776 --> 00:18:33,861
Well , have you ?

164
00:18:34,029 --> 00:18:36,781
