699
01:14:12,697 --> 01:14:16,367
Just ask the Waybourne girl to come in to see me , please .

700
01:14:16,534 --> 01:14:19,203
After luncheon will be convenient .

701
01:14:19,371 --> 01:14:20,663
Yes , Mrs Appleyard .

702
01:14:22,165 --> 01:14:23,416
Oh , and Miss Lumley .

703
01:14:24,459 --> 01:14:28,463
Do your best to forbid any idle and morbid gossip about this whole wretched business .

704
01:14:28,630 --> 01:14:31,215
Yes , Mrs Appleyard . I will .

705
01:14:40,392 --> 01:14:43,561
( ♪ BEETHOVEN : " Adagio " from 5th Piano Concerto )

706
01:15:21,808 --> 01:15:24,060
Who ? What ? Who is it ?

707
01:15:24,227 --> 01:15:25,561
Shh !

708
01:15:29,983 --> 01:15:31,317
Ah !

709
01:15:39,325 --> 01:15:43,078
Remarkable . Hmm .

710
01:15:44,289 --> 01:15:48,789
A week out in the bush and nothing more serious than shock and exposure .

711
01:15:52,047 --> 01:15:53,882
Extraordinary !

712
01:15:55,133 --> 01:15:56,676
No bones broken .

713
01:15:57,677 --> 01:16:01,889
Some cuts and bruises to the face and hands .

714
01:16:04,100 --> 01:16:06,393
