715
01:16:11,316 --> 01:16:13,151
Quite scratched .

716
01:16:15,028 --> 01:16:18,406
The fingernails are all torn and broken .

717
01:16:19,449 --> 01:16:22,410
There are several other unusual features .

718
01:16:23,411 --> 01:16:26,288
Her head is quite badly bruised .

719
01:16:27,290 --> 01:16:30,626
Probable concussion .

720
01:16:30,794 --> 01:16:32,545
A blow , maybe ?

721
01:16:33,755 --> 01:16:35,173
Or a fall ?

722
01:16:37,175 --> 01:16:39,302
But then if she fell

723
01:16:40,470 --> 01:16:43,306
why is the rest of the body unmarked ?

724
01:16:44,974 --> 01:16:46,809
It 's quite unblemished .

725
01:16:48,561 --> 01:16:53,061
And the feet , too , are quite unmarked , which is very strange

726
01:16:54,234 --> 01:16:58,279
