727
01:16:58,446 --> 01:17:00,865
We found no trace of ' em up on the rock .

728
01:17:04,619 --> 01:17:06,996
She 's quite intact .

729
01:17:09,582 --> 01:17:13,544
I 'd give my head to know what really happened up there .

730
01:17:17,423 --> 01:17:19,133
She 's quite intact .

731
01:17:21,761 --> 01:17:22,762
