What is it , my girl ?

733
01:17:26,432 --> 01:17:28,851
Well , ma 'am , it 's Miss Irma .

734
01:17:29,018 --> 01:17:29,935
Yes ?

735
01:17:30,937 --> 01:17:33,689
Well , it 's about her clothing .

736
01:17:33,857 --> 01:17:35,859
What is it , my dear ?

737
01:17:36,025 --> 01:17:40,279
Well , I didn 't know whether the sergeant should be told .

738
01:17:40,446 --> 01:17:44,158
There 's ... There 's no corset .

739
01:17:44,325 --> 01:17:47,494
Miss Irma 's corset . It 's missing .

740
01:17:47,662 --> 01:17:52,162
You did right , my dear . It can 't possibly be of any interest .

741
01:17:54,961 --> 01:17:58,589
( TOM SINGS ) ♪ Tis my sorrow sorest

742
01:17:59,716 --> 01:18:02,802
♪ Sad the falling forest

743
01:18:02,969 --> 01:18:07,469
♪ The north wind brings me no rest ... ♪

744
01:18:08,683 --> 01:18:10,685
( HE CONTINUES SINGING THE TUNE )

745
01:18:15,982 --> 01:18:18,943
Any number of unsolved murders there are .

746
01:18:23,865 --> 01:18:26,659
Take ... Take Jack the Ripper , for instance .

747
01:18:35,752 --> 01:18:38,379
The police are up there again , naturally .

748
01:18:38,546 --> 01:18:40,172
Thick as flies .

749
