And unless all your outstanding fees are paid by Easter ,

774
01:21:08,363 --> 01:21:12,492
I 'm afraid we shall have to make other arrangements .

775
01:21:14,285 --> 01:21:17,579
You know what that means , don 't you , Sara ?

776
01:21:19,999 --> 01:21:22,126
You will have to go away .

777
01:21:24,003 --> 01:21:27,464
There are places for girls in your predicament .

778
01:21:27,632 --> 01:21:29,091
Institutions .

779
01:21:36,224 --> 01:21:38,184
Now off you go .

780
01:21:39,936 --> 01:21:41,687
Sara .

781
01:22:05,753 --> 01:22:08,881
Sara ! What 's wrong with you ?

782
01:22:11,175 --> 01:22:12,843
Are you feeling ill " ?

783
01:22:15,721 --> 01:22:18,724
People don 't sit on cold steps in the dark unless they 're weak in the head .

784
01:22:23,646 --> 01:22:26,357
You heard the bell . Go and wash for supper .

785
01:22:32,947 --> 01:22:34,823
